## Extinction law info file.
## This specifies certain properties about the extinction law that are used during SED fitting and saving of results

## The short-hand name of the law, that will be stored in the results table
name  KMH94Indebetouw2005

## Construction: the KMH94 R_V=5.5 curve (whitney.r550) with its 1-30 micron opacity column replaced by a log-log-linear interpolation through eight measured points, scaled to the curve's own Ks opacity; V and the ultraviolet are the unmodified curve.
## J-[8.0] A_lambda/A_K: Indebetouw et al. 2005, ApJ 619, 931, Table 1, three-field average.
## [24] A_lambda/A_K: Flaherty et al. 2007, ApJ 663, 1069, section 4.2, mean of Serpens (0.44) and NGC 2068/71 (0.52).

## The column indices of the wavelength and opacity columns in the sibling .par file
colidx_wav   0
colidx_extinction  3

## The ratio of AV / AK in this law
AV_over_AK  7.050800
